{"article_ids": ["bbcb79fadd39dd32", "e626a6ba37c5cdca"], "canonical_title": "ChatGPT’s new Wallet lets AI agents shop and check out for you", "category": "ai_agents", "confidence": 0.96, "description": "OpenAI introduced a ChatGPT Wallet that lets its Dots AI agents shop and check out on a user’s behalf. The feature is rolling out today to ChatGPT Pro subscribers in the United States who are at least 18 years old, have a US billing address, and use an eligible US‑issued American Express, Chase, Mastercard or Visa card.", "entities": ["org:openai", "product:chatgpt"], "first_seen": "2026-11-13T16:00:12Z", "id": "evt_bbcb79fadd39dd32", "importance_score": 5.643, "last_updated": "2026-11-13T20:45:10Z", "source_ids": ["techcrunch-ai", "the-verge-ai"]}
